{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001107","compactId":"SO_0001107","id":"SO:0001107","label":"beta_bulge","definition":{"text":"A motif of three residues within a beta-sheet in which the main chains of two consecutive residues are H-bonded to that of the third, and in which the dihedral angles are as follows: Residue(i): -140 degrees < phi(l) -20 degrees , -90 degrees < psi(l) < 40 degrees. Residue (i+1): -180 degrees < phi < -25 degrees or +120 degrees < phi < +180 degrees, +40 degrees < psi < +180 degrees or -180 degrees < psi < -120 degrees.","xrefs":["EBIBS:GAR","http://www.ebi.ac.uk/msd-srv/msdmotif/"]},"comments":[],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"beta bulge"}],"xrefs":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beta_bulge"],"subsets":["biosapiens"],"altIds":["BS:00208"],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0001107/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files"}]},"parents":["SO:0001078"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0001078","SO:0001070","SO:0000839","SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[],"graphNeighborhood":{"parents":["http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001078"],"children":[],"related":[]}},"graph":{"parents":[{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0001078","id":"SO:0001078","label":"polypeptide_secondary_structure"}],"children":[],"related":[]}}